      "text": "HARMONICA FEN FESTIVAL 2026 – the festival (official video)\nOfficial video of the HARMONICA FEN FESTIVAL 2026.\nThe festival took place from 29 to 31 May 2026 in the Kulturbrauerei Berlin and connected the harmonica again with related instruments like the accordion, the Chinese sheng and the jaw harp.\nFEN stands for Fascination - Education - Network\n_______________________________\nHARMONICA FEN FESTIVAL 2026\n29–31/05/2026\nKulturbrauerei Berlin\n_________________________________\nLine-up 2026\nFriday\nHermine Deurloo & Anton Goudsmit\nSeth Shumate & Ryland Burhans ft. Adam Sikora and Sören Birke\nKeith Dunn & Klaas Wendling\nSaturday\nSteven De bruyn & Roshanak Rafani\nIndiara Sfair & band\nSväng\nSunday\nYotam Ben-Or\nJohn Henry ft. Mikael Bäckman\nFree Reed Ensemble\n__________________________________\n👇👇👇\nUpcoming event\nHARMONICA FEN FESTIVAL 2028\n19–21 May 2028\nKulturbrauerei Berlin\nhttps://harmonica-fen-festival.com/newsletter/\n_______________________________\nThe HARMONICA FEN FESTIVAL is the only international festival in Berlin dedicated to the harmonica and related insruments.\nThe festivals is organised by FEN MUSIC in cooperation with CONSENSE GMBH and is a partner of the Calella Harmonica…",
