      "llm_reason": "Cy Leo公開發布口琴現場演出影片，屬口琴演奏者更新，適合收錄。",
      "text": "(Live) Forgiveness 諒 - Cy Leo at Two Worlds In One (HK)\nLive performance footage at Two Worlds In One (Hong Kong) concert curated by Cy Leo on 30th August, 2026.\n在一個爾虞我詐、世態炎涼的世代，仍然能夠保持內心的溫度與容量，才是我們最大的功名。諒，是諒解 —— 諒人，也諒己。\n每個成年人心中總有幾根刺，執着過去的自己，懊惱曾經的事。這幾根刺，釘好了便不願離開，總使我們隱隱作痛。隨着時間，以為癒合過了，卻原來只是藏在內心深處。\n把它們拔出來，有時候是靠一段對話，有時候是靠一段經歷，也有時候是靠一首歌。\nIn a world where deception thrives and the the chill of indifference numbs the spirit, true greatness lies in holding onto the warmth and depth of the heart. Forgiveness — forgiving others, and forgiving ourselves.\nEvery soul bears a handful of thorns, stubbornly clutching to past selves and mourning what once was. These thorns, once driven deep, resist removal, whispering quiet pain. Over time, we tell ourselves they have healed, yet in truth, they lie hidden in the shadows of the heart.\nSometimes, they are pulled free through a heartfelt conversation. Other times, through a profound experience, or perhaps, a song that touches the soul.\nTwo Worlds Variation\nCredit:\nComposer: Cy Leo\nArranger: Cy Leo\nForgiveness 諒\nCredit:\nComposer: Cy Leo\nArranger: Cy Leo\nLyricist: Ashley Lin\nPianist: Daniel Chu\nElectric Bassist: Jaeshin Park\nElectric Guitarist: Teriver …",
