      "llm_reason": "Cy Leo 口琴演出影片，含現場演出與口琴演奏者資訊，屬公開更新且與口琴直接相關。",
      "text": "Two Worlds 在兩個心中間坐下 - Cy Leo ft. Ashley Lin & Walter Kwan\nLive performance footage at Two Worlds In One (Hong Kong) concert curated by Cy Leo on 30th August, 2026.\n《Two Worlds》的概念源自純音樂與人聲：兩種幾乎處於二元對立的音樂世界。然而，世界的事物往往正是由「對立」的兩極拼湊而成，才能形成一體。虛實、黑白、光暗，也是因為彼此對照，才得以賦予自身的意義。\n「無他，擁抱吧。」\n在周耀輝老師的筆下，世界上對立的事物，或許都能透過一個擁抱找到和諧。\nFrom Before昔時\nCredit:\nComposer: Cy Leo\nArranger: Cy Leo\nHarmonicist: Cy Leo/ Ramiel Leung/ Harry Choi/ Jerry Wong/ Timothy Yip/ 英皇書院同學會小學口琴小組\nTwo Worlds 在兩個心中間坐下\nCredit:\nComposer: Cy Leo\nArranger: Cy Leo\nLyricist: Chow Yiu Fai\nVocalists: Ashley Lin, Walter Kwan\nPianist: Daniel Chu\nElectric Bassist: Jaeshin Park\nElectric Guitarist: Teriver Cheung\nDrummer: Jongkuk Kim\nBacking Vocalists: Mia Fung, Kelly Yau\nViolinist: Vivian SHEN\nCellist: Kevin LAM\nHarmonicist: Cy Leo/ Ramiel Leung/ Harry Choi/ Jerry Wong/ Timothy Yip/ 英皇書院同學會小學口琴小組\nRecording Engineer: Jonathan Lam\nMixing Engineer: Jonathan Lam\nVideographer: Chris Lai\nPhotographer: Kevin Ku\nLighting designer: Ma Mui\nHair: Frankie Tang\nMake Up: Gi Ue Lam\nOutfit sponsor: Natacha Van",
