      "text": "「香兒」首場越南專場音樂會「流不息」精華片段 | The Hong Kong Children's Choir in Concert “Everything Flows” | Highlights\n「香兒」2026 新加坡及越南交流演出壓軸重頭戲——越南專場音樂會「流不息（Everything Flows）」於胡志明市大劇院完滿落幕。是次為「香兒」首次踏足越南，並成為香港首隊於越南舉辦專場音樂會的兒童合唱團。本場音樂會由獲香港駐新加坡經濟貿易辦事處贊助、香港越南商會支持並由「香兒」與西貢交響樂團合作呈獻。在古典法式建築拱頂下，由音樂總監兼首席指揮霍嘉敏帶領，Concert Choir演繹多首中西合唱作品，當中亦包含廣東話曲目，展現濃厚的香港音樂特色。\nThe highlight of HKCC’s Tour to Singapore & Vietnam 2026 — The Hong Kong Children’s Choir in Concert “Everything Flows” concluded successfully at the Saigon Opera House in Ho Chi Minh City.\nThis marked HKCC’s debut performance in Vietnam, making it the first children’s choir from Hong Kong to have a concert in Vietnam. Sponsored by the Hong Kong Economic and Trade Office in Singapore and supported by the Hong Kong Business Association Vietnam (HKBAV), the concert was co-presented by HKCC and the Saigon Philharmonic Orchestra. Led by Music Director and Principal Conductor Kathy Fok, the concert showcased a diverse repertoire of Chinese and Western choral works, including Cantonese pieces that highlight Hong Kong’s distinctive musical characteristics beneath the landmark’s classical French dome.\n#hkcchoir #TheHongKongChildrensChoir #ConcertTour2026 #Vietnam",
