      "llm_reason": "貼文內容為口琴演出分享，含 harmonica 標籤與現場演出照片，屬口琴演奏者公開更新。",
      "text": "Yesterday was the last date of the summer season and it had to be havin a gooood time!First of all because working with @bbbluesportugal of my good friends @73ruiguerreiro and @dulio_canario its always perfect!they and their team love the blues and put all their heart and pride to have us in the best conditions …sound,food,hotel,€ etc and most of all warmness!!! And to do it with my brothers @emilianojuarezmusic @vacasmanagement and @nicolysergic plus our beloved blues and soul diva @deborah.woodson.heck its all the way and always easy,fun and very exciting!!!! Thanks all the people that ended up dancing and singing with us!!!MUITO OBRIGADO!!!! The very cool pics are from @luis.macedo.fotografia @hohnerharmonica #bluesportugal #harmonica #blueswoman #bluesguitar",
