      "text": "House Of The Rising Sun 🎶\nOne of the most haunting traditional folk‑blues ballads.\nNo lyrics today, just harmonica carrying its sad, timeless story from New Orleans.\nThis old song has traveled across decades, telling a tale of loss and regret.",
