      "llm_reason": "口琴演奏者 Howard Levy 公開發布新作與錄音，屬口琴相關更新，非一般音樂貼文。",
      "text": "“Niccolò’s Notion” is OUT NOW. 🔥 I’ve been looking forward to finally sharing the studio recording of this piece.\nInspired by Paganini’s Moto Perpetuo, I created something harmonica players can truly claim as their own in the Paganini tradition: the very first virtuoso perpetual-motion showpiece written for diatonic harmonica, and for harmonica players worldwide.\nFast, relentless, and a little bit crazy, pushing the instrument to its limits, it is one of the most demanding pieces I’ve ever written or recorded. I hope other harp players will eventually take it on and make it their own.\nIt’s also the lead single from my new solo album, Heavy World. 🎧 Listen now wherever you stream music, and pre-save the album. (link in bio)\nTurn it up and enjoy the ride!⚡️\n#newmusicrelease #howardlevy #harmonica #virtuoso #paganini",
