      "text": "📌 2025年9月27 日｜臺灣・滬尾藝文休閒園區\n李讓：《銀河之詩》第三樂章〈獵人與大小獵犬〉\n2023年，我們邀請好友李讓 @jangli_harmonica 為樂團量身打造了三樂章作品《銀河之詩》。\n這部作品以夜空中最亮的「天狼星」為意象，融合了作曲家對我們多年來凝聚口琴熱情的細實觀察。音樂從〈恆星之巔〉的能量碰撞與縹緲收束，過渡到帶有臺灣土地生機與水氣的〈小島星空〉，最終在〈獵人與大小獵犬〉中爆發出強大的生命力。\n在藝文環境充滿挑戰的時代，這首曲子不僅描繪了星空的浩瀚，更刻劃出我們心中對口琴世界的純粹想像，是一部充滿情感溫度的音樂見證。\n📌 演出者｜\n天狼星口琴樂團：陳彥銘、陳奕翔、蔡明憲、張晁滕、王衍華、黃冠誌\n李讓 (口琴)\n林垣橙（小提琴）\n周霈恩（中提琴）\n游沛橙（大提琴）\n📌 完整《銀河之詩》影片:\nhttps://youtu.be/Gmpc5xOuhPc?si=wBhV6nyOE6h22IqQ\n--\n📌 September 27, 2025｜Taiwan・FAB Green Village\nJang Li: The Epic of Galaxy, Movement III — “The Hunter and the Hound”\nIn 2023, we invited our dear friend Jang Li to create a three-movement work, Poem of the Galaxy, specially tailored for our ensemble.\nInspired by Sirius, the brightest star in the night sky, this work also reflects the composer’s thoughtful and delicate observations of the passion for harmonica music that we have cultivated over the years. The music begins with the energetic collisions and ethereal conclusion of “Stellar,” then moves into “Starry Sky on the Island,” a movement infused with the vitality and humidity of the land of Taiwan, before finally bursting forth with powerful life force in “The Hunter and the Hound.”\nIn an era where the arts and cultura…",
