          "text": "Harmonica Playground – September Session\nJoin us for our 5th Monthly Interest Group Session!\n🗓 13 September 2026 (Sunday)\n🕑 2:00–3:00 PM\n📍 HAS Clubhouse\n21 Smith Street #03-01, Singapore 058935\nThis month, we’ll revisit:\n🎶 月亮代表我的心\n🎶 Jambalaya\n🎶 送别\n🎶 Dayung Sampan\n✨ New song: Sukiyaki\nBring your harmonica and join us for a relaxed afternoon of playing and learning together. No pressure, just play! All are welcome, so feel free to invite your friends too! 🎶\n——\n口琴乐园 · 九月活动\n欢迎参加我们的第 5 场每月兴趣小组活动！\n🗓 2026年9月13日（星期日）\n🕑 下午 2:00–3:00\n📍 HAS Clubhouse\n21 Smith Street #03-01, Singapore 058935\n本月我们将一起复习：\n🎶《月亮代表我的心》\n🎶 Jambalaya\n🎶《送别》\n🎶 Dayung Sampan\n✨ 新曲学习：Sukiyaki\n带上您的口琴，在轻松愉快的氛围中一起吹奏、学习和分享音乐。轻松吹奏，毫无压力！ 欢迎所有朋友参加，也欢迎邀请对口琴或音乐有兴趣的朋友一起来！🎶\n#HASSingapore #HarmonicaPlayground #HarmonicaSingapore #Harmonica #口琴\nhttps://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1712443750887697&set=a.488903699908381",
