          "text": "12-Bar Blues Harmonica Melody in D | 3rd Position\n🔥 Learn the complete melody step by step with sheet music + tabs on Patreon:\nhttps://patreon.com/konstantinreinfeld\nSave 20% with the annual Patreon membership.\n🎵 12-Bar Blues Harmonica Melody #2 – D in 3rd Position\nThis is part 2 of my 7-part series where I teach seven original 12-bar blues melodies in seven different keys.\nThis time we’re playing in D – 3rd position on a C harmonica.\nNo overblows. No overdraws. Just regular bending.\nIn this short YouTube version, I mainly play the complete melody so you can hear how it sounds and get a feel for the phrasing.\n⚠️ On Patreon, you get:\n• the complete 16-minute lesson\n• sheet music\n• harmonica tabs\n• note-by-note analysis\n• bends and phrasing explained\n• the full 7-part blues melody series as it grows\n👉 Learn the complete melody here:\nhttps://patreon.com/konstantinreinfeld\nChoose the annual membership to save 20%.\n🎵 Backing track used in this video:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2yF3E1iZy9U\n//\n► Online harmonica lessons:\nlessons@konstantinreinfeld.com\n► Patreon:\nhttps://patreon.com/konstantinreinfeld\n► DIY Harmonica:\nhttps://a.co/d/23xZIip\n► Website:\nhttps://konstantinreinfeld.com\n►…",
