          "llm_reason": "口琴社群公開活動，含演出、交流與音樂會資訊，屬可收錄更新。",
          "text": "Wonderful Sunday 欢乐星期天 – September Edition!\nJoin us next Sunday for another wonderful afternoon of harmonica, music and friendship! ❤️\n📅 20 September 2026 (Sunday)\n🕑 2:00–3:00 PM\n📍 HAS Clubhouse, 21 Smith Street #03-01\n✨ This month’s highlights:\n1️⃣ STUDIO 8 八琴韵室口琴重奏团 — with special piano accompaniment by Mr. Zhang Yifen 张以芬\n2️⃣ Cantonese Song Meets Harmonica 粤曲遇见口琴 — Branda Choy & Simon Leung\n3️⃣ Solo Performance 独奏 — Mr. Ng Choon Seng 黄春成《花儿与少年》\nPlus mini games, play along, tea reception and member interactions! ☕🎵\nAll are welcome — bring your harmonica and join us! 😊\n——\n欢乐星期天（9月份）\n20/09/2026, 2-3pm\n1️⃣ 首先，八琴韵室口琴重奏团 / STUDIO 8 将为我们呈现精彩的首半场表演，也特别邀请张以芬先生为表演演奏钢琴。\n2️⃣ 接下来，是＂粵曲遇见口琴＂团友Branda 将演唱粤语歌曲，Simon Leung老师口琴伴奏\n3️⃣ 最后，黄春成老师为我\n们独奏：花儿与少年。\n特别的日子，安排给特别的你。来吧，在这九月份欢乐星期天，让我们共享一个欢乐美好的音乐盛会\n结束后，将会有小小茶点，让大家放轻松交流\n#WonderfulSunday #欢乐星期天 #HarmonicaAficionadosSociety #HASSingapore\nhttps://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1720112656787473&set=a.488903699908381",
