          "text": "Learn This 12-Bar Jazz Blues Melody on Harmonica | G in 2nd Position\n🔥 Learn the complete melody step by step + get the sheet music on Patreon:\nhttps://patreon.com/konstantinreinfeld\nSave 20% with the annual Patreon membership.\n🎵 12-Bar Blues Harmonica Melody #1 – G / 2nd Position\nThis is the first part of a new 7-part series where I teach seven original 12-bar blues melodies in seven different keys.\nWe start in G – 2nd position on a C harmonica.\nThe idea behind the series: strong, melodic blues playing without relying on overblows or overdraws. Everything is playable with regular bends.\nIn this short YouTube version, I play the complete melody and introduce the concept behind the series.\n⚠️ On Patreon, you get:\n• the full 17-minute step-by-step lesson\n• sheet music for the complete melody\n• detailed breakdown of bends and phrasing\n• all upcoming lessons from the 7-part series\nThe next lessons will cover C, D, E, F, A and B♭.\n👉 Get the full lesson + sheet music here:\nhttps://patreon.com/konstantinreinfeld\nChoose the annual membership to save 20%.\nThe backing track I used:\nhttps://youtu.be/1E9Qk-mJXdA\n//\n► Online harmonica lessons:\nlessons@konstantinreinfeld.com\n► Patreon:\nhttps://…",
