          "text": "Catch CY Leo in Singapore this October!\n这个十月，在新加坡感受 CY Leo 的口琴魅力！\nOne weekend, two harmonica concerts — two different experiences!\n一个周末，两场口琴音乐会，两种不同的精彩！\n🎵 3 Oct — CY Leo 何卓彦 & Band\n《Two Worlds in One 二合为一》\nAsia Tour Singapore Stop — a rare chance to catch CY Leo & Band live!\n亚洲巡演新加坡站，难得机会，别错过！\n🎟️ Tickets: https://www.sistic.com.sg/events/two1026\n🎵 4 Oct — Qin Yuan 51《琴缘51》\nA Tapestry of Harmonics\nCY Leo joins our local harmonica performers for another evening of harmonica music!\nCY Leo 携手本地口琴演奏者同台演出，再续精彩琴声！\n🎟️ Tickets: Albert 9670 1118 or DM us\n✨ Going to both? Enjoy $5 OFF Qin Yuan 51 with your CY Leo concert ticket!\n✨ 两场都看更划算！凭 CY Leo 音乐会门票购买《琴缘51》，可享 $5 优惠！\nOctober is just around the corner — make it a full weekend of harmonica music!\n十月将至，两场精彩音乐会，一个口琴音乐周末！两场都别错过！\n#CYLeo #HarmonicaSingapore #QinYuan51 #Harmonica #HASSingapore\nhttps://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1713491540782918&set=a.488903699908381",
