          "llm_reason": "",
          "text": "【# 演出回顧】新加坡及越南交流演出｜2026 海外演出重溫音樂會「Everything Flows 流不息」✨\n「香兒」2026 年 7 月為期 11 天的新加坡及越南海外交流演出圓滿落幕，並於 8 月 1 日順利舉辦2026 海外演出重溫音樂會「Everything Flows 流不息」。\n是次跨地域音樂交流，不僅是「香兒」首次踏足越南的重要里程碑、更讓團員累積寶貴演出經驗、拓闊國際視野，以音樂會友。\n由衷感謝各大媒體鼎力報導，記錄「香兒」這段難得的海外交流歷程，讓這段充滿意義的音樂旅程被更多人看見。同時感謝香港駐新加坡經濟貿易辦事處對是次交流演出的支持！\n【#Performance Recap】 Concert Tour to Singapore and Vietnam 2026｜Post-Tour Concert 2026 “Everything Flows” ✨\nHKCC’s 11-day concert tour to Singapore and Vietnam in July 2026 has come to a successful conclusion, followed by our Post-Tour Concert 2026 Everything Flows held on 1 August.\nMarking its debut performance in Vietnam, this cross-border musical exchange stands as a significant milestone for the HKCC. It has allowed members to gain valuable onstage experience, broaden their international horizons and connect with others through the power of music.\nWe sincerely appreciate the extensive coverage from all media outlets, which has wonderfully documented this precious overseas journey and shared our meaningful musical exchange with the wider public. We also thank the Hong Kong Economic and Trade Office in Singapore for its support towards this tour.\n#hkcchoir #ConcertTour2026 #EverythingFlows",
