          "llm_reason": "",
          "text": ".\nTwo days, endless inspiration, and world-class choral music right here in Hong Kong 🎶\nSet to take center stage on 27–28 December, the Hong Kong International Choral Gala (HKICG) brings together renowned international maestros, guest choirs, and Hong Kong’s brightest rising singers and conductors packed with music-making.\nHere’s what’s happening across the two days:\n✨ Opening Symposium & Roundtable\n✨ Choral Workshop\n✨ Conducting Masterclass\n✨ Open Rehearsal\n✨ “ASIAN HARMONY” Night Concert\nWe’re thrilled to partner with the Asian Choral Association (ACA) for this milestone event, which also stands as a key highlight of the 79th Hong Kong Schools Music Festival (2027).\nLooking for the perfect gift this Boxing Day weekend? Treat yourself to two days of incredible music—head to the link in our bio for full details and tickets! 🎟️🎁\n--------------------------------------------\n一連兩天的合唱音樂盛會，即將在香港呈獻 🎶\n香港國際合唱薈萃 (HKICG) 將於 12 月 27 至 28 日 隆重登場。我們特別匯聚了國際頂尖指揮、客席合唱團，與本地具潛質的青年歌者及指揮，一同探索合唱藝術的無限可能。\n兩天精采節目包括：\n✨ 開幕研討會\n✨ 合唱工作坊\n✨ 指揮大師班\n✨ 公開綵排\n✨「ASIAN HARMONY」晚間音樂會\n是次活動由協會與亞洲合唱協會 (ACA) 聯手打造，不僅樹立了區域交流的歷史性里程碑，更為第 79 屆香港學校音樂節 (2027) 展開意義非凡的一頁。\n過完 Boxing Day，不妨來現場收下這份專屬於音樂的節日禮物！請即點擊 Bio 連結了解更多詳情及購票！🎟️🎁\n#Ho…",
