          "text": "BBQ BLUES & BREWS\n9/5 @ Austell Towne Park 2780 Jefferson St Austell GA\nAustell, get ready—BBQ, Blues & Brews is coming to Austell Towne Park on Saturday, September 5, from 10 AM–10 PM!\nBlack Hat Blues is bringing a powerful day of live music, great food, cold craft brews, and family fun—with a special Mississippi blues connection in the house.\n🎸 Cannonball Red & The Head Hunters\n🎵 Deak Harp\n🔥 Featuring Harrell “Young Rell” Davenport\n🎤 Special All-Star Finale with Chuck Beattie “Dr. Blues” and all artists on stage\nBring the family, bring your dancing shoes, and come celebrate good food, great blues, and the community spirit of Austell!\n📍 Austell Towne Park\n2780 Jefferson Street, Austell, GA 30168\n🗓 Saturday, September 5\n⏰ 10 AM–10 PM\n#BBQBluesAndBrews #AustellGA #AustellTownePark #BlackHatBlues #CannonballRed",
