          "llm_reason": "貼文明確提到 Harmonica Bridge Festival 與口琴演出影片，屬口琴公開更新與交流內容。",
          "text": "We had a lot of fun at the Harmonica Bridge Festival in Torun,Poland 🇵🇱 .Here is a little glimpse of it!The videos are from different telephones...\nWe had a lot of fun at the Harmonica Bridge Festival in Torun,Poland 🇵🇱 .Here is a little glimpse of it!The videos are from different telephones and dont have the best quality but its enough to feel the good times we had!i love playin with my friends @emilianojuarezmusic @katrinamarrupe @josueb_musik @pkevinklein @jacovito_conga cause besides the fun we have on the stage ,we have it outside of it! THANKS so much to my friend and great harp player @slawekwierzcholski Sławek Wierzcholski for putting this together with the help of the Torun town hall,and for inviting me one more times See ya next 4th sept at @quasimodoberlin for the album release concert!!! @hohnerharmonica @galileomusicdeutschland @nordesiaproducions @vacasmanagement #harmonica #latinharmonica #nómade #mundharmonika #worldmusic @rodharpfx @seelectronics",
