          "text": "🇹🇼 2026臺灣口琴音樂節 🇹🇼\n感謝 @taiwanharmonica 的盛情邀請🙏 感謝主辦單位 @siriusharmonicaensemble 及音響控制的 @minnie.o6i8 ，以及所有熱心的工作人員，讓這次活動順利完美🎶\n很高興能與友團 @punch.harp 一起合作演奏《海闊天空》 🦅 那份感動和默契實在令我們難忘❤️\n回顧RedBricks的表演🎵 感謝每一位觀眾熱烈的掌聲與鼓勵👏 是你們給予我們無限動力🔋我們特別演奏了《一路向北》和《擱淺》，希望大家都喜歡這份心意✨\n期待未來能再次參與臺灣口琴音樂節，與大家相聚交流，一起享受音樂的美好時光💫\nThanks so much to the Taiwan Harmonica Music Festival for the warm invitation🙏 Big thanks to the organizer, Sirius Harmonica Ensemble, sound engineer Ming Hsun Tsai, and all the dedicated staff who made this event run so smoothly and perfectly🎶\nWe were thrilled to collaborate with our friends from Punch to perform Beyond’s 海闊天空🦅 — that feeling of ensembleship and emotion is truly unforgettable❤️\nLooking back on RedBricks’ performance 🎵 We’re deeply grateful for every enthusiastic round of applause and encouragement from the audience👏Your support fuels us endlessly🔋We specially performed Jay Chou’s 一路向北 and 擱淺🎼 We hope everyone felt the heart behind these songs ✨\nWe look forward to joining the Taiwan Harmonica Music Festival again in the future, to gather, share, and enjoy the beautiful moments music brings us all 💫\n#redbricksharmonica #臺灣口琴音樂節 #thmf #performance #口琴",
